# harfbuzz is declared here because freetype links libharfbuzz.so.0 and does
# not declare it, so dwm installed cleanly and then died with
# "libharfbuzz.so.0: cannot open shared object file". The correct fix is on
# freetype, but freetype and harfbuzz link each other and that cycle is not
# something to introduce into the base dependency graph untested.
